@startuml
title A kitchen at night
' Three regions outside any state: PlantUML draws them side by side,
' each from its own start, with no line between them.
[*] --> Dark
Dark --> Lit : switch
Lit --> Dark : switch
--
[*] --> Quiet
Quiet --> Humming : compressor on
Humming --> Quiet : cold enough
||
[*] --> Oven
state Oven {
  [*] --> Off
  Off --> Heating : turn the knob
  Heating --> Off : turn it back
}
@enduml
